==================================================
LEVEL 7 - PANDAS MERGE / JOIN

VERY IMPORTANT.

Suppose:

customers.csv

customer_id | name

transactions.csv

customer_id | amount

You need to combine them.

Learn:

df1.merge(
df2,
on="customer_id"
)

Understand:

- inner join
- left join
- right join
- outer join

You do not need advanced SQL.

Just understand the idea:

MATCH RECORDS USING A COMMON KEY.

